<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Dan.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Daniel ne laisiukwak aide rau kegaibe lie la. Laisiukwak pelane Daniel nah pe zangme hadung nah Daniel da peting dau hemang lam de keulia kegai kegwang (605-530 BC).</para>
  <para style="ip">Daniel de Jerusalem gade 605 bekum hebaang tui teu Babylonia deu ga gwangdi. Pa Nebuchadnezzar mang ranggai nah pekie rang kegai cai pecu kengkieng peu gai. Pa laisiukwak aide Israelme hebaang tei kela dau minadung de teingku eh maleune kezeu kelabe Tinggwang de nlum bam lulo ranggai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide kekamlega, Daniel au kideu gwangramdung cuhlu nah kaudi kela pe mangau hadung raugai nah kamtu ga kelungta bam kera gwangram cuh kera hade.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Nebuchadnezzar hegwang tingdau hadung (1:1-4:37)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tangdeu gage rau kegaide (5:1-30)</para>
  <para style="io2">Daniel hingho bung ga (5:31-6:28)</para>
  <para style="io2">Belshazzar hegwang tingdau makengau (7:1-8:27)</para>
  <para style="io3">Daniel kekie nah riakhena “henadung” (9:1-27)</para>
  <para style="io3">Daniel de peuci kegai kekambe (10:1-12:13)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Babylon gade Daniel heciem kereli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Judah deu gwangpei Jehoiakim hegwang tei kelu mmi pe kecumbe kum, Babylonme gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar Jerusalem ga gwang nah namdi de twagwa lu mania la kegwang pelane tei mtak ti lu kerane. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Rampaube Nebuchadnezzar de Judahme gu hegwangpei Jehoiakim reu ngkiengkelu peu, nah pa pecu Tinggwang ki gade kemci niadung de peu. Pa penuide Babylonme deu gage ngngwa gwanglu, pe tinggwang ki gage, nah pa kemci niadung de pe rabe mabamdung gage kailu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:7">2 Hel. 36:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Nebuchadnezzar pekang ga ditube Ashpenaz dage Israelme kangge hegwangme kelak gade de nah kelak keyidung gade de ngngwa peda gwanglo aja kaibeu, <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />rehangme lunghmau kemakme, hezu keyime, ningcing kemriakme, maci nah kecikecet le kepui tei kebamme, nah hegwangki ga heta teilu kebuime. Pecu penui dage Babylonme gu hekwa helet ledeubeu kera rangbeu. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Hegwangpei penui ziemne tingba ramsang ne tyei kera penuide hegwangpei tyei kela taktyeidung de nah pa sak kela zau pwa peu la. Rehangme aidungde de tingkum kecum ziemne heta ledeu nah reli kera peu, nah cipau cai, penui hegwangpei gwa tei kerane. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Aipaumedung kakgade Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, nah Azariah, aidung de Judah leuh gade kedet kelume <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Ashpenaz penuide hezi msiakpeu: Pa Daniel de Belteshazzar qulu, Hananiah de Shadrach qulu, Mishael de Meshach qulu, nah Azariah de Abednego qulu.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Dede Daniel au pe lungcet gade pekatei pecu hegwangpei taktyeidung mede pa sak kela zau lepwa pecu renet zai gade mci kemak tei lak lie cetlu. Cine pa Ashpenaz dade pekatei pecu tei hera di me kera aja kiegai. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Cidau Tinggwang ne Ashpenaz de helung teibeu eh Daniel dage suiyi nah kehung nah herüt peda bam kera peu. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Kedibe Daniel dage rangdi, “Ih a mpaube hegwangpei de hing. Pa nang taktyei dai tyei nah sak maisia bi acu aja peu pwabam. Daitei eh pa rehangme n heume kak gade ncu lepwa ngausia di lulai? N ziemne hegwangpei a peu dangdi lubui bam.” <verse eid="DAN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Cine kedibe ne Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael nah Azariah de pie rengei kera nlum kegai Melzar de Daniel kempau. <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />Pa rangdi, “Ziangrei ge ziemne anuide, n kilamedung de kedak pielo. Anuide tyei kera ginei nah dui saklu kera rünne peulo. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Iciu eh anuide rehangme hegwangpei taktyei tyei kebamme de keu heda pie lulo, delwe nnui kengau rehi nzwa eh anui dage nnui ta teigai lulo.”<verse eid="DAN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Cine hegwa keteibe pecu ngngwa suizwa lu, nah penuide ziangrei ting ge kedak pie. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Ziangrei cang kedi benai, rehangmedung hegwangpei taktyei keyi leu tyei kebamme swade penui yi ncang, nah penui lui de yikidi. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Cine hegwa keteibe hegwangpei taktyei keyidung nah zau penui dade keu nzia di delwe penui de ginei rünne peu gai. <verse eid="DAN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Rehang mdai aidungde dage, Tinggwang ne maci nah hekwahelet cilu kela helung ningcing maci leune peu, nah Daniel marengeidung nah hemangdung leune cilu bamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:5">Jas. 1:5</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 1:17">17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Hegwangpei ne peting riet kenzeu de cangdi eh penuide ngngwa gwang kera ting di ge, kedibe penuide ngngwa Nabuchadnezzar dwa gwanglu. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Hegwangpei penuide kempau gai, nah hemaabe kakgade migede Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, nah Azariah penui nzwa heda cang gailakdi. Penui hegwangpei dwa ga sap eh pe gwatei kera mteilu. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Ningcing maci teu hegwangpei penuide ma keteu kegai leune gade, pe hegwangram ga kerekamedung pelane nah ketsaime de mpau lie rang kelamedung swade penui pia kerei ge yiki lie kecu penuide ngaulu. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Daniel cika hegwangpei Cyrus mmi raitube hegwang tei kecu kecang hegwatei bam.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Nebuchadnezzar Mang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Nebuchadnezzar hegwang tei kelu mmi pekenabe kum, pa hemangdung ge mmi. Pa pelung hemau tadi, nah pa zip gailakdi. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Cine hegwangpei rekamedung nah ketsaime de mpau lalie rang kelamedung de qugai. Pa kehemeumedung nah makecimedung de de qugai. Pa penuide peu pe mang ha rang kera ranggai. Cine penui gwanglu delwe hegwangpei dwaga saplu. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Hegwangpei penui dage ranggai, “Ih hemang ge mmi, nah Ih a lung gade hemang cide pekie daipai bi kecu cineu süt bam.” <verse eid="DAN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Ge makecimedung Aramme let gade hegwangpei de mpau, “Hegwangpei, kelungta lunglo! Hemang cide n kilame dage ranglia lo, iciude anui pekie cide ranglia beu luzie.” <verse eid="DAN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Hegwangpei penui sam keligai, “Ih aide tiak mci luda. Nnui amang de a dage ranglia gai nah cide pekie ranglia beu melu di cai, nnui pum be teurak lwe cak mzi dizie nah nnui kidung ralie bau ge teidi zie. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Dede magade nnui a dage a mang nah pekie cide ranglia beu cai, nnui mapeudung, nah ziehi, nah herüt kedi ngaulu zie. Cine acu hemang cide nah pekie ranglia beu lo.” <verse eid="DAN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Penui sam keli eh rangdai, “Peu hegwangpei de anui pe kilamedung dage hemang cide ranglia lo, iciude anui pekie cide ncu ranglia beulu kerane.” <verse eid="DAN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Hegwangpei sam keligai, “Nnui peting teutielu neu kebam Ih ci mci bam dida, kedanemene nnui Ih aide tiak mcigi pwa kebam ci kelune. <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Dede magade nnui hemang cide a dage rangbeu melu liecai, nnui ziemne cika samtiege gwale gah. Nnui kenret nah kecwa samdung Ih a lung keli dai kemaktane a dage cide rang kera kesuisam lwe mtei luda. Cine cu au, hemang cide a dage rangbeu lo, nah iciu eh nnui a ziemne pekie ranglia lukebui Ih cilu kerane.” <verse eid="DAN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Makecimedung hegwangpei dage pesam keligai, “Kideureu ga hegwangpei kie kebam de teicang lu kera migede gah da. Madaude hegwang kendu nah kengkieng gede kerekame, mede ketsaime de kempau lalie kecume, mede makecime dade ai kenzwa tei kera kie kecu tei ma. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Hegwangpei kie kebam cide au tei gailak, nah cide migede rang gailak heradung ne zielie maige, nah penui au mina kakga lungh bam ma.” <verse eid="DAN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Sam aide hegwangpei siupwa pe rata nah deiga sütdi, nah Babylon ga makecime kebam pelane de teitsetdi kera pa aja kaigai. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Cine makecime lie kela leune de teitsetdi kera aja kaidi. Aja aide ziemne Daniel nah pe zangmedung de peei gwang iciu eh penuide teitsetdi lu kerane.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Ge Daniel hegwangpei reketme reu muibe Arioch, Babylon ga makecime lie kela leune de teitsetdi zielie gwang kelabe dage pa cet sünne nah mriaksüt delwe pe sam keligai. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Daniel hegwangpei kangga kedibe dade keteu, “Daitei luge hegwangpei aja aide kelwa neu lano?” Cine Arioch Daniel dage daitei dibi kecu ranglia gai. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Ge Daniel zette lüt delwe pecu peu hegwangpei de redau lu kerane kiegai, iciu eh pa hemang rangswalu kebui hegwangpei dage lialu kerane.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Pecai Daniel kilung gwang delwe Hananiah, Mishael, nah Azariah dage daitei dibi kecu ranglia gai. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />Daniel penui dage Tinggwang tinggim ga kebambe dade macet kecuk ha cide ziemne ngaugia kielu kera ranggai, iciu eh pa nah penuide de Babylon ga makecime lie kela leune de si delwe teitsetdi melu kerane. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Cipau ziu macet kecuk cide marengei gade Daniel dage liagai. Cidau Daniel tinggim Tinggwang de hetwa peu <verse eid="DAN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />cine Daniel Tinggwang de twadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">“Tinggwang zi kelungta twalo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">kedanemene maci nah kengkieng au pe gu kecune.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Pa pe tingdung teikedi dila nah pe hidung de;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">pa hegwangdung de keugi dila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">nah hegwangdung de penui gwangbam gage kaibeu la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">Pa ningcing makecime de peu la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">nah cilu kelame dage maci peula.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Pa makecok nah kebai kenzeu dung liabeu la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">kedanemene pa kemui ga dai bambi kecu cila kecune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">nah kebaa ne pecu twagwa bam.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />A paumedung Tinggwang, Ih ncu twa nah rütla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">nang acu ningcing maci nah kengkieng kepeu ne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">Cu au n dade anui kie kebam de nang acu peu cigai da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">hegwangpei dage ranglu kebui nang anui dage liabeu da.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel Hemang kie kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Pecai Daniel Arioch (Babylon ga makecime lie kela leune de teitset kera hegwangpei ne nlum kegaibe de) de redau kera tetgai. Pa mie pe dade rangdi, “Babylon ga makecimedung de teitsetdi helo. Acu ngngwa hegwangpei da gwang beulo nah Ih hegwangpei dage pe mang cide lia nah rangswa gaibeu kerane.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Ge Arioch kelwa delwe hegwangpei dwa gage Daniel de ngngwa gwanglu eh pa rangdi, “Langgi kedi Judahme kak gade mi hangge hegwangpei mang pekie ranglu kebui kauge de Ih ngau luda.” <verse eid="DAN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Hegwangpei Daniel (Belteshazzar qu kelabe) dage rangdi, “Nang Ih hemang mmi kegaide nah pekie cide a dage rangbeu lubui ni?” <verse eid="DAN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Daniel hegwangpei sam keligai, “Hegwangpei keteu kebam macet kecuk aide makecime ne ranglia gailak, mede ketsaime de mpau kelamedung ne de, mede kerekamedung ne de, nah hekeihegi ha kecimedung ne de ranglia gailak. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Iciu liede, macet kecuk liabeu kela tinggim ga ring kebam Tinggwang ge bam, nah pa hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar, n dage peu ci kegai teila, gwang kela tingbaziedung ga dai teigwang ziebi kecu. Hemang nang n zeu ga zeu kebam dau n peusui gade mmi kegai mang au aide da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:8">Ken. 40:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Nah hegwangpei, nziemne au, nang n zeu gade mmi kecu de au heta tei gwang kerabe dung delie, nah macet kecuk keulia kelabe dai teigwang lai zeubi kecu peu ncu ci gaila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:13">Amo. 4:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Nah a ziemne au, macet kecuk aide acu keulia kebeu au Ih mi keda ringkela medung leune swade maci kiee kecu ziemne ma. Macet kecuk ha aide acu keulia kebeu au, hegwangpei, ncu peu pekie aide cilu kerane, iciu eh n mlungsing ga nang cet kela de peu cilu kerane.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />Hegwangpei, nang ngangcuh piegai, ge mamie kedi ge sap eh ngau. Mamie aide, ngkieng nah baa süt ge n dwaga sap. Pe keba cide pie kehing ge. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Cide pepeu kecak mcitube le teilu. Pe hekarak nah pe ba au rangkang geu le teilu. Pekia penai pekeling au hetageu le tei, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />nah pepi au hegeu le tei. Nah pe pideu au hegeu nah lidei le teilu. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Nang ngangcuh piegai, nah tangtsu ge dang mpet gai, cide mina ba gene de ma, iciu eh cide mamie pideu hegeu nah lidei le tei kenzeu gage kedeugai, nah cide tei takcaidi. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Ge hegeu de, lidei, hetageu, rangkanggeu nah kecak, cidung pelane de piage gage pangpop kecaidi nah hepok dau hecaipung ga tsiurie nzwa bam di. Tingkai ne cidung de guipwa tetdi nah penui caimie magede bam si tadi. Dede mamie de kedeu kegaibe tangtsu cide lamlwatu kedi ge cu eh kideureu pelane gum puidi. <verse eid="DAN 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />Aide n mang da. Cu anui hegwangpei de pekie ranglia zieda. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Nang, hegwangpei, au hegwangdung reu hegwangbe Tinggwang ne ncu hegwangram, kengkieng, ngking, nah kendu kepeube. <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />Mina lungh kela deu de pa ne n ba gage kaibeu da. Luh ga makaunedung nah tingkam ga nruinedung pa ne n ba gage kaibeu da, nah peu ncu penui reu hegwang tei kera pa ne ncu tei beu da. Mamie gu kecak peu de nang delie. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />N cai ga, hegwangram kedage cuh dai zie, cide n swade ceu zie, nah pecai de hetageu le tei kelu hegwangram kedage cuh eh kideu pelane reu hegwang tei zie. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Hegwangram pe mdaibe cuh zie, cide hegeu nzwa ngkieng zie, kedanemene hegeu au ma kedadung nah ma pelane de kedeu takcai dila. Cide ma aidung pelane kedeu pop nah penuide tei takcai dizie. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Nang pe pideu lidei le nah hegeu le tei kenzeu kengau nzwa, hegwangram cide pang mzi kedi hegwangram ge zie; kangge da hegeu nzwa pe kengkieng bam zie. Cide hegeu nah kenciep lidei hai ncüt kebam nang kengau de nzwa da. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Pe pideu cide hegeu nah lidei le tei kelu nzwa, hegwangram cide kesa ngkieng nah kesa mnei zie. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Nang hegeu nah lidei hai ncüt kebam kengau nzwa, minadung de hai ncüt dizie; penui ncüt eh bamlak, hegeu lidei de ncüt gai kelak nzwa. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Cipau hegwangmedung tingdau, tinggim ga kebam Tinggwang madau de ngkap gai kelak hegwangram ge teucuh zie, cide mina kedage ne de ngam gailak. Cide hegwangram kedadung teipang teipop takcai dizie, nah penui pelane de tei nggah dizie, nah cide kelungta bam dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Keu. 11:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Lamlwatu ge gade tangtsu ge dang mpet kecu nzwa eh, dede cide mina ba ne kemak nang ngau kecu nzwa. Tangtsu cide hegeu, hetageu, lidei, rangkang geu, nah kecakdung de kedeu takcaidi. Kendu Tinggwang peu n dage ci gaila, hegwangpei, aipau cai dai teigwang zie bi kecu. Hemang aide kesang nah pekie rangswa kebeu aide nlumlu kebui ge.<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar pezu keumie Daniel dwa ga nah pecu hetwa peugai; pa mapeu ratak nah marim kehengui pwa pecu peu kera aja kaigai. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Hegwangpei Daniel dage rangdi, “Kesangda, n Tinggwang au heradung reu Tinggwang da, hegwangmedung reu Rampaube, nah macet kecuk keulia kelabe, kedanemene nang macet kecuk aide keulia beu da.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Hez. 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Hegwangpei iciu eh Daniel de herüt peu süt nah miswakegah mapeudung kekiee peu. Babylon deuceu reu hegwang pecu teibeu. Babylon ga macitume kakgade Daniel ne deuceudi ditube teidi. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Daniel hegwangpei dage kiegai, nah hegwangpei Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego de Babylon deuceu ga kedime teibeu. Dede Daniel au hegwangki ga bamdi.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Kecak mamie nah mimang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar kecak le mamie teilu pehu cubit riakherok nah pedi cubit herok kecu ge. Pa cide Babylon deuceu lungga Dura Langkie gage pwacuh lu. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Iciu eh Nebuchadnezzar samdung langpwa deuceu ga deuceudi medung, cuikui ga deuceudi medung, deuketna deuceudi medung, nah cika ge si eh hezai kecimedung, mabam keteumedung, tutiakmedung, hetu-hera tei kelamedung, nah deuceu ga kedime leune de gwang ncüt kera qugai mamie tei kenzeu de ga gwang kerane. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Cine deuceu ga deuceudi medung, cuikui ga deuceudi medung, deuketna deuceudi medung, nah cika ge si eh hezai kecimedung, mabam keteumedung, tutiakmedung, hetu-hera tei kelamedung, nah deuceu ga kedime leune gwang eh Nebuchadnezzar mamie pwacuh kelude tei kemci ga gwang ngkwalu. Penui cipau dwaga saplu. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Sam sah kelame ge sahbak eh sahgai, “Nnui dage aja aide kaila, minadung, heleuhdung, hekwahelet leunedung, <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />nnui makii, terwaine, zither, lyre, harp, nah telui, nah leinet leune kwa kegai kwa siu keludau, nnui keumie delwe hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne pwacuh kenzeu kecak mie de de reca lu maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:10">Dan. 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Keheibe de cide keumie delwe reca kemakme, cipau tingsiak dau penuide kelien pwa miheu mimang gage kaigai dizie.” <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Cine mina pelane de makii, terwaine, zither, lyre, harp, nah telui, nah leinet leune kwa kegai kwa siu keludau, minadung, heleuhdung, nah hekwahelet leune de hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne pwacuh kegai kecak mamie cide de reca di.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Cipau ting dau, Chaldeame Jewme de kemmau sam keulwe gwang. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Penui hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar dage rang eh cu, “Hegwangpei, kelungta ringlo! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Nang, hegwangpei ne hezai tei luda, iciu eh mileune de makii, terwaine, zither, lyre, harp, nah telui, nah leinet leune kwa kegai kwa siu keludau keumie delwe kecak mamie cide reca lulo beu da. <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />Keheibe de cide keumie reca kemakme, de miheu mimang gage kelien gai di maisia. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Cu Jewme mikangge nang ne penuide Babylon deuceu reu ga kedi teigai kebeu medung bam; penui zi Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego. Mina aidungde, hegwangpei, nang rang kebeu de mzai ma. Penui n rabedung de reca nah pegwa tei meidi, mede penui nang ne pwa cuh kegai kecak mamie dwa ga keumie reca meidi.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Ge Nebuchadnezzar pe rata nah lunghop pui eh Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego penuide pe dwa ga ngngwa gwang lo aja kaigai. Cine penui aipau medung de ngngwa hegwangpei dwa ga gwang lu. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Nebuchadnezzar penui dage rangdi, “Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego, nnui a rabedung de raca lak lie mede Ih pwacuh kenzeu kecak mamie dwaga keumie cide nnui reca lak lie kecu nnui cet lu deni? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Cu magade nnui mtei lu decai, nnui makii, terwaine, zither, lyre, harp, nah telui, nah leinet leune kwa kegai kwa siu kelu dau, keumie delwe Ih pwacuh kenzeu kecak mamie cide reca lu cai, maleune de petau luzie. Dede magade nnui cide reca lu meidi cai, nnui de kelwa delwe miheu mimang heu kebam gage kelien gai dizie. A ba gade nnui de kelilu kera rabe cau ge bam no?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:35">2 Heg. 18:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego hegwangpei sam keligai, “Nebuchadnezzar, aipau ha de ga anui n sam keli kera gede bam meda. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Magade sam keli lu kera ge bam liecai, anui nlum kela anui Tinggwang anuide mi heu kebam gade gumkwak beu zie, nah n ba gade anuide keli beuzie, hegwangpei. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Dede magade cinzwa lu meliede, peu ncu ci gai la, hegwangpei, anui n rabedung de reca lak, nah anui nang pwacuh kenzeu kecak mie cide de keumie reca lak.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Ge Nebuchadnezzar perata sütdi; pezu pie eh ngau kegai Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego dwade lidi. Pa mimang cide lum kebam reu de tei lumpwa pia hena kieege tei lum si gai lo aja kaigai. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Iciu eh pa pe reugwame ngkieng süt kecume kangge de Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego de kang lwe miheu mimang cide gage kelien gai kera aja kaigai. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Cine penuide kanglu, penui pai, penui ncwa, penui peurwa, nah penui paini kedadung teu kela lui penuide mi heu kebam mimang gage kelien gaidi. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Hegwangpei aja de mzai siakte kelane nah miheu cide lum süt kezeu ne, miheu ne Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego de pwa lüt kelame de rutsetdi. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Mina hangcum Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego aide penuide kangpwa kebam dau miheu mimang ga cakmie di.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Ge hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar peswagah eh zette saplu. Pa pekang ga makeci kedime dade keteu, “Anui mina hangcum de mi gage kelien gai meni?” Penui hegwangpei sam keligai, “Cinzwa da, hegwangpei.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:19">Lei. 34:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Pa rangdi, “Dede Ih au mina hang mdai penuide de kang mene mi ga tet tegwa kebam ngauzeu, nah penuide rejam de dima. Iciu eh pemdaibe de au perehi tinggimgwame ge nzwa di.” <verse eid="DAN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Cine Nebuchadnezzar miheu mimang kikam taiga pet nna lwe qugai, “Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego, Hutube Tinggwang kilamedung, mpet lulo! Aika mpet lu!” Ge Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego mi gade mpet lu. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Ge cika gwang ngkwa kebam deuceu ga deuceudi medung, cuikui deuceudi medung, nah keda deuceudi medung, nah hegwangpei kangga makecimedng mina aidungde de ngau. Miheu ne penui pum rejam di ma; penui ba ga penui mai gede gap dima; penui paini kette teimsia di ma; nah penui dade mi rim gede nnam ma.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Nebuchadnezzar rangdi, “Anui Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego gu Tinggwang pe samgwame de langgai eh pe kilamedung dage sam kai kebeube de hetwa peu go. Penui Tinggwang de nlum pwa aja mzai meidi, nah penui penui Tinggwang rünne de gwale hera kedadung dwa keumie reca laklie penui pum kaigai. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Ciziemne Ih hezai aide peula, migede, heleuh keheibe de, mede hekwahelet keheibe de Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego Tinggwang de rang msia cai cipaume de teurakcak di maisia, nah penui kidung de ralie tumge teidi maisia kedanemene ci kenzwa kelilu kera hera keda kette gah kecune.” <verse eid="DAN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Iciu eh hegwangpei Shadrach, Meshach, nah Abednego de Babylon deuceu reu ga penui bam huki kecu gage keucuh beu.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Nebuchadnezzar Tsingbang Kemmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar hezai aide langpwa kideu ga lungh kebam mina leune, heleuh leune, nah hekwahelet leune dage kaigai: Peu nnui da kezuyibe bam kelube teilo. <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Marengeidung nah miswakegah batadung Hutube Tinggwang a dage tei kegai Ih nnui dage ranglia kera Ih a sui luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 66:16">Lei. 66:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Pegu marengeidung dai kenzwa gede di no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">nah pegu miswakegah batadung dai kenzwa gede ngkieng no!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Pe hegwangram au madaude siadi kelak hegwangram,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">nah pe kedi kengkieng ceheu ket cai ket bam mui lala.”<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />Ih, Nebuchadnezzar, a ki ga Ih a suiyi eh lungh bam, nah Ih kepui ngau eh a hegwangki ga kehega eh bam. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Dede zeuziu ge hemang ge Ih mmi ge acu tei ngngi süt. Ih zeu kebam dau, mamiedung nah marengeidung Ih a mang gade ngaukegai acu tei kebwak sütdi. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Cine Babylon ga pe maci kebamme pelane de a dwa ga ngngwa gwang lo Ih hezai kaigai iciu eh penui a mang pekie cide a dage ranglia beulu kerane. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Pecai kerekame, ketsaime de kempau lie rang kelame, ningcing kemriakme, hekei hegi ha kecime gwang. Ih penuide a mang ranglia beu, dede penui a dage hemang kie cide ranglia beu luma. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Daniel a dwa ga gwanglu, pe zi a rabe zi teu eh Belteshazzar msiaklu, nah pe da kemci rabedung la, nah Ih pecu a mang paulia. <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />Ih pe dage ranggai, “Belteshazzar, kerekame kakte ditubo, n da kemci tinggwangdung kela Ih ci nah macet kecuk gede nziemne au pa zu di ma. Ih a mang dai ngau bi nah pekie cide dai bi kecu a dage ranglia beu. <verse eid="DAN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Ih a zeu ga zip kebam dau ma aidungde a mang gade kengaubedung da: Ih piegai, nah kideu sumga tsingbang ge bam, nah pehu cide hu süt. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Tsingbang cide lungh cuh nah ngkieng süt cuhdi. Petün tinggim hangcang di, nah cide kideu penli kecang de ngaudi. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Cide penei hezuyi swet bam, petsi bui puiting bam, nah cika mileune ziemne taktyei bam. Renaam kaune pekang ga msiukelu ngaulu, nah nruinedung pekiakdung ga pecit teilu. Kering kaunedung pelane de cide gade matyei lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:32">Mat. 13:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />Ih zeu kebam dau a mang gade ngau, nah kemci samgwame ge tinggim gade nghung. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Pa sahbak eh rangdi, ‘Tsingbang be bi ngkaudi nah pe kiakdung bi kecai di, pe neidung riodi, nah pe tsi tei zangdi. Makaunedung de peu pe kang gade pak dilu nah nruinedung de peu pe kiakdung gade limtet dilu. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Pe tsingmui pe mah reilwe kideu gage pütdiak gailu, cide hegeu nah hetageu rianggoi gele kangdi, luh ga cehei kenciep sum gage. Peu cide kideu ga mabang kakga makaune de ngngwa lungh bam di. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Peu pe lungcet mina lungcet gade tei kelidi, nah makaune lungcet pecu pwapeu lu cide tingkum hena kah gwang kemaktane. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Hezai aide samgwabe kai kebeu gade tiak luda. Hetiak aide kemcibe ne teilu da, iciu eh ring kebammedung Hutube Tinggwang ne mina gwangramdung reu hegwang lie kecu cilu kerane nah pa ne hegwang cide pesuibe de peupwa penui reu gage kai beula, henahtume dage kecang de.’ <verse eid="DAN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />Ih, Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar, hemang aide mmi da. Cu nang, Belteshazzar, pekie cide rangpwa a da lialo, kedanemene a hegwangram ga maci kebamme migede pekie rangpwa a dage lialu kera gah da. Dede nang cide teilubui bam, kedanemene kemci tinggwang rabe n da kelane.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel hemang kie kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Ge Daniel, pezi Belteshazzar lie kelabe de, tingkakge pesui siasüt bamdi, nah pe macet pecu keheudi. Hegwangpei rangdi, “Belteshazzar, hemang aide le pwane mede pekie cide le pwane ncu keheu diso.” Belteshazzar pesam keligai, “A mpaubo, peu hemang cide ncu ngaurau kelame ziemne kelube teilo; nah pekie cide peu n ngauraume ziemne kelube teilo. <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Tsingbang nang kengau de, lungcuh ngkieng kelude, nah petün tinggim hangcang kebam de, nah cide kideu penli de ngau kebam de, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />penei hezu keyi de, nah petsi kepui tei kebam de, iciu eh cide ga mileune ziemne taktyei kebam, nah pekang ga luh ga makaunedung msiu kebam de, nah tinggimdung ga nruinedung lungh kebam de, <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />tsingbang aide nang delie, hegwangpei, nang lungcuh ngkieng süt kebambe de. N kendu mmi pwa tinggimdung hangcang dida, nah n kengkieng kideu penli ga miecang bam dida. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Nang ngauda, hegwangpei, kemci samgwame tinggim gade nghung lwe rang eh, ‘Tsingbang be bi ngkaudi nah cide ngkapti, dede pe mah reei kelu tsingmui be kideu gage pütdi lu, iciu eh cide hegeu nah hetageu le kang dilu, luh ga cehei kenciep sum gage. Peu cide tinggim gade hezin ne tei hwalu. Peu cide luh ga renaam kaunedung de ngngwa lungh bamdi tingkum hena kah gwang kemaktane.’ <verse eid="DAN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />Hegwangpei, pekie au aide da. Aide Hutube Tinggwang ne hezai tiak teikelu n dage gwangcang zeu da, hegwangpei, a mpaubo. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />Mina kak gade ncu gwagi dizie, nah nang luhdung ga renaam kaunedung de ngngwa lungh dizie. Hetumseu nzwa nang cehei tyei dizie, nah tinggimdung gade hezin le nang hua dizie, nah tingkum hena kahgwang dizie, iciu eh nang Hutube Tinggwang de pa ne mina gu hegwangramdung reu hegwang tei lalie kecu, nah pa ne pesui kelame de cide pwapeu lalie kecu ci eh pecu hetwa peu lu kemaktane. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Tsingbang mah cide kaidiak kera aja kai kebeu nzwa, nang tinggimdung ne hegwang teila lie kecu cilu de n hegwangram n da cailigwang dizie. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Ciziemne, hegwangpei, nang a keledeu sam luulu lo. Kemau teisi talu nah dai be mzui labi kecube teilo. Ma petau kemakdung gade nang nreu caililu iciu eh kegahme de ngaungia lu, iciu de nang lungyi luzie.<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hemang de teicang kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Ma aidung pelane Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar dage teigwang di. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Aipau cai kei kereiekena dige Babylon hegwangki reu ga pa tet nlwet mpet bam, <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />nah pa rangdi, “Aide Babylon namdi kedi de meni, Ih ne tei kelu a hegwangki, a hegwangbam kendu de ziemne?” <verse eid="DAN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Samdung pe muileu ne rangcang gailak kebam dau, tinggim gade sam ge gwang: “Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar, hegwangram aide n dade keuteu di delie rang mdu gaila. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Mina kak gade ncu gwagi dizie da, nah n ki au luhdung ga renaam kaunedung kebam ga zie. Ncu peu hetumseu nzwa cehei tyei kera tei dizie. Tingkum hena kahgwang dizie nang Hutube Tinggwang de pa ne mina hegwangramdung reu hegwang tei lalie kecu nah pa ne pesui kelame de cide pwapeu lalie kecu ci eh pecu hetwa peu lu kemaktane.” <verse eid="DAN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Tiak kelusam aide Nebuchadnezzar dage zette eh gwangcang di. Pecu mina kak gade gwagi di. Pa hetumseu nzwa cehei tyei di. Nah pepaau tinggimdung gade hezim le hwadi. Pe peutam tiepwa helie hesiumai tiege di, nah pe nceukwadung nruinedung nceukwa nzwadi.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />Cipau mmi hena de cang gwang dige Ih, Nebuchadnezzar, tinggim lege a miak ngang cuhgai, nah a peusui acu peu cailigai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">“Ih Hutube Tinggwang de hetwa peugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">nah Ih herüt nah kendu kelungta ring kelabe de peu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">Kedanemene pe hegwangbam au madaude siadi kelakpe gwangbam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">nah pe hegwangram ceheudung gade ceheudung pelane ga bammui la.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Pa au kideu ga lungh kebam leune de de magede kemak nzwa cetla;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">pa tinggim ga reugwame kak gade nah kideu ga lungh kembamme kak gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">pesui kelube tei dila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">Migede pecu kam gailak mede pecu renia gailak. Migede pe dage, ‘Daitei nang ainzwa tei zeuno rang gailak?’”<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />A da a peusui cailigwang kelu dau, a kengkieng nah a kebaa a da gwang dailu a hegwangram kendu ziemne. A kangga makecime nah kedime acu peei eh ngngwa dailu. A hegwangbam ga acu ngngwa gwang dailu, nah kendu kedi kieegwa kecu acu peusi. <verse eid="DAN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />Cu Ih, Nebuchadnezzar, tinggim ga Hegwangpei de hetwa kehu, nah herüt peula, kedanemene pa tei kelade petau, nah pe zai mzui. Pa ngang eh tet kelame de tei henadi lubui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:4">Hez. 32:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Tangdeu ga keraube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Belshazzar hegwang tei kebam ting dau, pa taktyei ngyi kedi ge pe kangga kebam kedime cang ge de ngngwa tyei, nah pa penui mina cang ge dwa gade zau sak. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Belshazzar zau nsi kegai dau, pa kecak mede rangkanggeu piakdung nah hekwakdung pe pei Nebuchadnezzar ne Jerusalem kerecaki gade keumpet keludung pwa gwanglo eh aja kaigai, iciu eh pa, pe kangga kedimedung, nah pe naudung nah pe nauseupuidung depeu cide pwalwe saklu kerane. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Jerusalem ga Tinggwang ki, kerecaki gade keuteu mpet kelu kecak kwakpiakdung kilamedung pwa gwangbeu. Hegwangpei, pe kangga kedimedung, nah pe naumedung nah pe nauseupuidung cidungde gade pwa sak. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Penui zau sak eh kecak, rangkanggeu, hetageu, hegeu, tsing, nah tangtsudung le tei kelu penui rabedung de hetwa peu bamdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hab. 2:19, Lei. 135:15-18</char></note><verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Cipau tingsiak dau mina ba zurangdung ge mitaubung bam dwaga mimiakngau tei eh ngau nah hegwang ki tangdeu ga marau di. Heba cide marau kezeu hegwangpei ngau. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Iciu eh hegwangpei pezu tsamdi nah pe kecet pecu keheudi; pepi peba pecu ngha beu tadi, nah pe ngkok mbeudi. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Hegwangpei sahbak eh ketsaime de kempau lu kela rang kelame de, makecime de, hekei hegi ha kecime de, ngngwa gwang lo aja kaigai. Babylon ga makecime lie keladung dage hegwangpei rangdi, “Kaurau aide nah pekie aide dai bi kecu ranglia kelume de peu gieremang paini teuzie nah kecak teiria peu pecu mtei zie. Cipaube de peu hegwangram ga kengkieng keteu ditube pekecumbe tei zie.” <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Cidau hegwangpei kangga kebam makecime lie kela leunedung gwang, dede penui migede cide pei de luma nah pekie rangpwa hegwangpei dage de lia lu tadi. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Ge Hegwangpei Belshazzar pe lung keherei sütdi nah pe zu tsamceu di. Pe kangga kebammedung de penui swagah di.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Cidau, hegwangpui taktyei ngyi kibung ga hegwangpei nah pe kangga kedime marang kebam siu kedine gwang. Hegwangpui rangdi, “Hegwangpei, kelungta lungh lalo! Peu n lungsuidung le ncu kebwak di so. N lung keherei eh sia di helo. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />N hegwangram ga peda kemci tinggwang rabe kela kauge bam. N pei tingdau, kebaa nah macilu kela maci rabedung maci pe da kebam ngauda. Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar, n pei hegwangpei pecu le pwa kerekamedung, nah ketsaime de resiu lie rangkela medung, makecimedung, nah hekei hegi ha kecimedung reu ditube tei beuda. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Mlangsüt kecu rabe, maci, kecikecet, hemang kie rangswalu kela, samregwadung ranglialu kela, nah ma kehebwak tei mduilu kelabe, Daniel, hegwangpei ne pezi Belteshazzar msiakpwa kenzeu mina aipaude da aikenzwa luilung keyi bam. Cu Daniel de qugai nah pa dai rauzeu bi kecu pekie n dage ranglia beu luzie.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Iciu eh Daniel de hegwangpei dwa ga ngngwa gwanglu. Hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Nang Daniel, apei hegwangpei ne Judah gade ngngwa mpet kelu langgi kedi Judahme hangge de deni? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Ih n ha siu luda, iciu eh rabedung rabe n da lalie kecu, nah kebaa nah kecikecet nah maci n da kela cilu da. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Cu makecime lie kelame nah ketsaime de resiu lie rangkela medung de rau kenzeu aide pei kera nah a dage pekie ranglia beu kera ngngwa a dwa gwang da, dede penui cide pekie ranglia lu tadi. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Nang ma kiedung rangswa lia lu kela nah ma kenaangdung teimdui lu kela ha Ih siu da. Cu nang magade rau kenzeu de peilia beu nah pekie a dage ranglia beu liecai, peu ncu paini gieremang ge kaizie nah kecak teiria ngngwang gage mteizie, nah ncu peu hegwangram ga kengkieng hutube pekecumbe peu teizie.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Ge Daniel Hegwangpei dage sam keligai, “Peu n mapeudung n katei nziemne kelube tei lulo, nah n ziehi mi kedage da peu kelube tei lulo. Iciu liede, Ih rau kenzeu de n ziemne pei beuzie nah pekie cide ranglia beuzie. <verse eid="DAN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Hegwangpei, n ziemne au, Hutube Tinggwang n pei Nebuchadnezzar de hegwangram, kedi, herüt nah kengkieng peu. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Pe kendu kedi Tinggwang peu kegaine, mina pelane, heleuhdung, hekwaheletdung mbeu eh pecu hingdi. Pa peu tsaidi keneume de teitsetdi la, nah pa peu ring eh bam keneume de peu ringlu la. Pa teucuh keneume de teucuh beula, nah tei hena keneume de tei hena beula. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Dede pa pelung hung nah ngang nah pe lung tak kedi dau, iciu eh pe bata teitwa teimau kedi dau, pecu pe hegwangbam gade keu nghungdi nah pe kengkieng de keu teudi. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Pecu mina kak gade gwa gidi, pe peusui makaune ge nzwadi, nah pa renaam ga gadadung de ngngwa lunghdi. Hetumseu nzwa pa cehei tyei. Tinggimdung gade hezin mie pepaau zim hwa, iciu eh pa Hutube Tinggwang ne hegwangram leune reu hegwang tei nah pa ne cide peu keneume leune reu ge kaibeu lie kecu cilu kemaktane. <verse eid="DAN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />Nang pe napei, Belshazzar, nang ma aidung pelane cibam dede nang n mlung henah luma. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Nang ngkatei ncu teu cuh pwa tinggim Tinggwang de renia la. Pe ki gade penui n da hekwakpiakdung pwagwang iciu eh nang, n kang ga kedimedung, n naudung nah n nauseupuidung cidung de pwa zau sak, nah nang rangkanggeu nah kecak, hetageu, hegeu, tsing, nah tangtsu le tei kelu mamiedung, mamie mangau la kemak, masiu la kemak, mede magede cila kemak miedung de twa bam dida. Nang Tinggwang peu ncu ring kebam nah n lampui pelane ci kelabe de rüt ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Job 12:10, Lei. 115:4-8</char></note> <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Iciu eh Tinggwang heba ge pa kebam gade langgai eh kerau aide tei gwanglu.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />Rau kenzeu de ainzwa da: ‘Mene, Mene, Tekel, Pharsin.’ <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Pekie ainzwa da: ‘Mene,’ ‘Tinggwang n hegwangram tingbazie pei dida nah cide penli gage keugwang dida.’ <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />‘Tekel,’ ‘n cu riangteukwak gage teu eh pie dida nah nang cangkemak ngau luda.’ <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />‘Pharsin,’ ‘n hegwangram mzipwa Medeme nah Persiame de peu dida.’”<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Ge Belshazzar aja kaigai, nah penui Daniel de gieremang paini kaibeu. Kecak teiria pe ngwang gage gwakbeu, nah hegwangpei pe hegwangram ga pecu lepwa ngkiengtu pe kecumbe teikelu rang mdugai. <verse eid="DAN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Cipau ziu Babylonme gu hegwangpei Belshazzar de teitsetdi, <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />nah Medeme pei Darius pa mmi riakherokekena dige Babylon hegwangram cide luulu.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Daniel Hingho bung ga kebam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Darius hegwangram reu deuceudi 120 gede kedet kera pesui lu hegwangram pelane reu kedi tei kerame de. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Penui pelane reu ditume hangcum bam, nah Daniel de cipaume kakte hangge. Kedime hangcum de de peu deuceu reu kedimedung puisau teibeu kerane kedetlu, iciu eh hegwangpei kengkap gede dau melu kerane. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Deuceu reu kedimedung nah penui ditumedung hangcum kak gade Daniel de pwa penai reu ge kai, kedanemene pe da yi tsamceu kecu rabe kela ziemne. Hegwangpei Daniel de hegwangram pelane reu kedibe tei kera cetla.<verse eid="DAN 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Ge kedime keda kena nah deuceu reu kedimedung Daniel de mmau kerane pe bata ga ma teimau gaikera peei ladi, dede penui pecu mmau kera gede ngaulu ma mede pa peta tei kela gade teicang la kemak gede ngau luma kedanemene pa au samsang kecune. Teimau kegai mede teicang kemak gede pe dade ngau luma. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Ge mina aipaumedung rangdi, “Anui Daniel de mmaugai kera kie gede ngaulu meda pe Tinggwang zaidung gade mage mmau kera ngau lu zielie mai.” <verse eid="DAN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Ge kedimedung nah deuceudi dung hegwangpei dage penui mage rim teugwang. Penui pe dage rangdi, “Hegwangpei Darius, nang kelungta ring lalo! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Hegwangram ga ditumedung pelane, cuikui ga kedimedung, deuceu ga deuceudidung, muiteume nah deuceudi dung ncüt delwe mpau nah kesamdau lu nang, hegwangpei, hezai ge tei mpet beu nah cide mzai bi kera telei beulu, iciu eh caugame zie camrei ge, hegwangpei, ncu rünne mene, hera keda ge mede mina dade kekie tei cai, cipaube de kelien pwa hinghodung kebam hekwaki gage kaizie. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Cu, Hegwangpei, aja tei mpet gai nah cika ge n zi giak dilo, iciu eh Medeme nah Persiame zai mzui eh cide teili daidi me kera ziemne, iciu eh cide keu caili melu kerane.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Cine hegwangpei Darius laisiu cikage giakdi aja cide hezai teidi.<verse eid="DAN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Laisiu cide giak pwa hezai teidi delie kecu Daniel ci kelu dau, pa pe ki ga gwanglu (cide Jerusalem lebie ncwa kebam kibung nreube hebaki ngkei nzeu), nah pa koktungmie, pa tingba ramsang piacum tei bam kela nzwa, nah kekie tei nah pe Tinggwang dwade hetwa peu, cide pa keda dau teibam kela ge. <verse eid="DAN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Mina aidungde pa kekie tei kebam tuih zielie telei kebammedung Daniel pe Tinggwang dade ngaugia nah kengha kie kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Ge penui hegwangpei da gwang delwe pa aja kai kenzeu ha rang: “Zie camrei ge kakga keheibe de, nang hegwangpei, ncu rünne gwale hera kedage mede mige dade de kekie teicai cipaume de hingho kebam hekwaki gage kelien gai di kera nang aja kai melui ni?” Ge hegwangpei sam keligai, “Peha cide tei mci dida, cide Medeme penai Persiame zai rehi nzwa delwe; cide teili dai gailakta.” <verse eid="DAN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Ge penui hegwangpei sam keligai, “Daniel lie kela Judahme deu gade langgi kedibe de, hegwangpei, pa n sam kingnei meidi nah nang aja kaipwa n bagiak kai kenzeu de lepwa malie meda. Pa pe Tinggwang dade tingba ramsang ne piacum kekie teila.” <verse eid="DAN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Hegwangpei sam aide siu luge, pa pelung siadi, nah pa Daniel de pe ba gade kelilu kera ziemne pe lung gade cet lu. Pa Daniel de keli kerane tingnaimiak kenlüt kecang de laikai tei. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Ge hecim aide riem ncüt kelumedung hegwangpei da gwang ngkwalu delwe pe dage rangdi, “Ci lulo, hegwangpei, hezai ai Medeme nah Persiame zai da, aja gede mede hezai gede hegwangpei ne kai kedi be kette teili gailak.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Cine hegwangpei aja kaigai, nah penui Daniel de ngngwa gwang lu, nah penui Daniel de hingho kibung gage kelien gaidi. Hegwangpei Daniel dage rangdi, “Peu n Tinggwang, nang samsang eh pegwa tei jüja bam kelabe de ncu kelibeu lo.” <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Tangtsu ge pwagwang eh hingho de kai pwa kebam hekwaki kimui reu ge kaidi, nah hegwangpei pe hegwang kaudap kai kelu nah pe kangga kedime gu kaudap le tangtsu cide kaudap kaidi, iciu eh magene de Daniel de keli melu kerane. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Ge hegwangpei pe hegwangki ga cailigwang di nah pa cipau ziu mmwang. Pe dage kehemeu kerenga tadung kette tei ma, nah pa ziplu ma.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Ge tingba pet ge hegwangpei cuhlu nah zette hingho kwaki gage tetgai. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Pa hingho kwaki cide pet nna kezeu dau, pa pelung keceu kwa gade Daniel de qu eh ranggai, “Daniel, ringkela Tinggwang kilabo, n Tinggwang, nang pegwa tei jüja kelabe, ncu hinghodung dade kelilu deni?” <verse eid="DAN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Ge Daniel hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Hegwangpei, kelungta ring kelube tei lo! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />A Tinggwang pe samgwame ge de langgai eh hingho muidung keba luda, nah penui acu kette rejam di ma. Kedanemene pe dwa gade de nah, hegwangpei, n dwa gade de a mau gede bam eh acu ngaulu kemakne, nah Ih n dage ma kesia ge de teigai ma.” <verse eid="DAN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Ge hegwangpei pesuiyi sütdi. Daniel de hingho kwaki gade teu mpet kera aja kaigai. Cine Daniel de hekwaki cikade teu mpet lu. Pecu rejam kezeu gede ngaulu ma, kedanemene pa pe Tinggwang de nlum kelune.<verse eid="DAN 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Hegwangpei aja kaigai, nah Daniel de mmau kela leune de ngngwa gwang eh penuide hingho kwaki gage kelien gaidi, penui, penui name, nah penui naudung de de. Penui cakmie hangdeu de tung kemakne, hinghodung penui reu nsaucuh nah penui ra dung cak takcai ra dedi. <verse eid="DAN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Ge hegwangpei Darius kideu ga lungh kebam minadung, heleuhdung, nah hekwahelet leune dage raugai:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:25">“Peu lungciep n dade kieesi kelube teilo. <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Ih aja aide kaila, a hegwangram lungga kebam pelane de Daniel Tinggwang mie hing lulo beu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">kedanemene pa au ringkela Tinggwang lu nah pa kelungta ringla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">nah pe hegwangram ngkapdi gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">pa penli kecang hegwang teizie.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Pa anuide gumkwak luda nah kelilu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">nah marengeidung nah miswakega batadung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">tinggim gade nah kideu gade teila;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">pa Daniel de hinghodung kengkieng gade gumkwak beuda.” <verse eid="DAN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Cine Daniel Darius hegwang tei kebam tingdau nah Persiame pei Cyrus tingdau lunghyi sütlu.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Daniel Makaune Mdai kemmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Babylonia gwangpei Belshazzar hegwang teikelu raitube kum, Daniel pe zeu ga zip kebam dau pa hemang ge mmi nah marengei ge ngau. Ge pa pemang lede dai ngaubi cide raulu. Pa ma kenlang bedung rau lu: <verse eid="DAN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />Daniel ranggai, “Tingmui a mang lede tinggim ga tingkai tu mdai gade jaaidi ga guilwa kebam Ih ngau.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Keu. 7:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Makau kedi ketsamtsam mdai jaaidi gade mpet. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Raitube kau de au hingho nzwa dede helie nzwa pe hesiudung pung. Ih pie kebam dau, pe hesiudung hietdi nah kideu gade cide de teucuh di nah mina nzwa pe pi kena le peu sap. Cipaude de mina lungcet peu. <verse eid="DAN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Makau pekenabe de cika bam, cide hegum nzwa, cide keumie delwe bam; cide pemui ga pegei kak gage hetupakra kecum ngki lwe bam. Cipau de dage, ‘Cuhlu iciu eh mina kekie gede tyeilu,’ de rangbeu. <verse eid="DAN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />Aipau cai Ih piedai gai. Cika makau keda ge bam dai, cide kaudau na kenzwa ge. Pe gim ga cide nruine hesiu nzwa pe hesiudung mdai bam, nah pe peudung de mdai bam. Pecu hegwang teu kera kengkieng peu nzeu. <verse eid="DAN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Aipau cai de tingmui a mang gade makau pe mdaibe ngau, cide nretkei, ngau kehing, nah ngking süt kecuge. Pe gei hegeu gei disüt kecu ge; bang kenzeu pelane de cide ne tyeilu, ngki kecai, nah pe pidau tei di. Cide keda kaunedung swa de cam, nah cide pekiidung kereei bam. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Ih pekiidung pie mcet kebam dau, Ih piegai nah penui kak gade pekii keda ge pwakcuh kedi Ih ngau, keceuna ge. Pekiidung keraibe kecum de pema gade keriak mpetdi. Pekii aide ga pemiak mina miak nzwa nah hegie nah ngang süt eh kwadi kwa kecu mui ge kebam Ih ngau.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />Ih pie gaige,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">hegwang bamdung pebam siak ga bam lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">nah Ringbammui kelabe pe bam ga bamlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">Pe painidung de ha pwa buising nzwa di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">nah pe tam meurün mai kemcibe nzwa di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">Pe hegwangbam miheudung nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">nah pe pitadung au mi heu kebam ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:14">Keu. 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Pe dwa gade mi reuki lwa pet bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">mina pe cang cang pegwa teibam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">nah mina nia haige pe dwa sap bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">Tutiakki ngkwa eh kempau bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">nah laisiukwakdung let pwabam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jer. 17:1, Lei. 56:8, Mal. 3:16, Keu. 20:12</char></note> <verse eid="DAN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Ih pie jüja bam kedanemene pekii cide sam kedidung rang kebam ne. Makaune de teitset kebam Ih pie bam, nah pepum ngkapdi, nah cide ru kera ziemne peudi. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Nah makau keda mdaidung dade au, penui hegwang tei kera kengkieng penui dade keuteudi, dede penui teilung tingkak ge ziemne tei mtie pwapeu.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />A mang lede cipau ziu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:13">mige mina nabe nzwa tinggim ga hemwa de ngngwa gwangkela Ih ngau;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:13">pa Ringbammui kelabe da gwang</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:13">nah pe dwa gage pecu kailu.<verse eid="DAN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Hegwang tei kera kengkieng nah kendu nah kehu kengkieng pecu pwapeu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">iciu eh mina pelane, heleuhdung, nah helet leune de pe gwatei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">Pecu hegwang tei kera kengkieng kepeu cide au kelungta bam kerabe cide au bammui zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">nah pe hegwangram au madaude ngkapdi gai kelak ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Keu. 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hemang kie rang kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Nah Ih, Daniel, a rabe au a lung gade hap bamdi, nah hemang Ih ngau kegai de acu kebwak bamdi. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Cika sap kebam mi hangge da Ih gwang eh ma aidungde pekie acu liagai lo Ih keteu. <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />‘Makau kedi mdai aidungde au, hegwang mdai kideu gade cuh kerabe da. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Dede Hutube gu minadung ne hegwangram de luulu zie, nah penui ne kelungta nah kelungta penui gu tei dizie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:27">Dan. 7:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Ge Ih makau pemdai be ha cisi neu di, cide keda kaunedung swade camceu nah ngau hingsüt kecuge, pegei hegeu gei nah pe nceu hetageu nceu; cipaude bang kenzeudung tyeilu, teipang pwa teikecai di, nah pe pi le caiketet. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Ih pe peu ga kii kereei ha de de, nah kii kedage pwak cuh, nah cipau kii dwa gade pe kii kecum nghai kedi ha de de Ih cineu di. Ih cipau kii de pe miakdung kebam nah sam kedidung rangpwa pecu ngngwa kebam medung swade di eh samdung rangkebam mui ha de de Ih cineu di.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan. 7:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Ih pie kebam dau, pe kii aide kemci minadung de hereu regi delwe penuide ngamlu bamdi <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />Ringbammui kelabe gwang kemaktane, nah Hutube gu kemci minadung mzeu pwapeu kemaktane. Ge kemci minadung hegwangram luu kelu ting gwanglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat. 19:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Ge cika sap kebambe de ainzwa ranggai, ‘Makau pe mdaibe de au,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:23">cide kideu ga hegwangram pe mdaibe zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:23">iciu eh cide hegwangram kedabedung pelane swade tsam zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:23">Cide kideu pelane de tuityei zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:23">nah cide pidau dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:23">nah teipang kecai dizie.<verse eid="DAN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Nah pe kii kereidung de au,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:24">hegwangram aide gade hegwang kereei cuh zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:24">nah penui cai ga kedage cuh zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:24">Pedwa medung swade pa au tsam zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:24">nah pa hegwangdung kecum de ngamlu dizie. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Pa Hutube de sam kesia teu eh rang zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:25">nah Hutube Tinggwang gu kemci minadung de teikeherei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:25">Pa hengyidung nah hezaidung teili kera tei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:25">Ma aidungde pe ba gage kaipwa peu zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:25">tingkum ge, tingkum kena, nah tingkum pempie ge ziemne.<verse eid="DAN 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Dede tinggim tutiakki ga kempau bam zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:26">nah penui pe dade pe kengkieng keuteu dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:26">kamtube ga pecu ngamlu nah ngkapdi kerane. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Pe hegwangram nah pa gum keludung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:27">nah tinggim pekiene kangga pe hegwangramdung kendu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:27">cide pwa minadung Hutube gu kemci minadung de peu dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:27">Pe hegwangram au kelungta bam kera hegwangram,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:27">nah hegwangram kedadung pelane de pe gwatei nah pe sam mzai zie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Keu. 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Aide hemang penlibe da. Ih, Daniel, a ziemne au, a kecetdung acu keheu süt nah a swa gahdi. Dede Ih aide akatei aziemne kai nzeu luda.”<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Daniel meurünseu nah hemeuseu kengau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Hegwangpei Belshazzar hegwang tei kelu mmi pekecum bekum, Ih Daniel, hemang ge ngau (hemang keraibe ngau kelu cai). <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Ih pie kebam dau, Ih Elam deuceu ga rietegwa kelu Susa namga bam eh amang gade ngau. Ih Ulai Reuki tai ga bam eh amang gade Ih ngau. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Ih ngang piegai, ge a dwaga meurünseu pekii kena kebam hereuki mbie ga bam eh Ih ngau. Kii ket swa kedabe tieki, dede ketie de kedui de swade pemmi nneu nah kedui dene ketie de petie mmi kah di. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Meurünseu cide naimiak kenlütle, tingtünle, tingbangle ntau eh kebam Ih ngau; makau keda gede pedwa de ngkieng luma. Penui migene de pe ba gade mige de de kelilu ma. Pa tei keneu leu teilu, nah pa mdu petdi. <verse eid="DAN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Ih aide cet eh kebam dau, naimiak kenlütle de hemeuseu ge gwang kela Ih ngau, cide pak nzet süt eh, hangdeu tung cu ci mene kideu peureu pelane kah gwangdi. Hemeu cide pe miak kena kakga pekii kedi ge bam. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Pa meurünseu pekii kena kebam da gwang, Ih meurünseu cide kereuki kung ga sap kebam Ih ngau, nah hemeuseu cide meurünseu lamge kengkieng kailwe pak gwang di. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Hemeuseu meurünseu da nna gwang kedi Ih ngau. Pa meurünseu de de pe rata süt eh la, iciu eh pa meurünseu de ntau gai eh pekii kena teicumdi. Meurünseu cide pedwa ga saplu kera pe kengkieng gahdi. Hemeuseu cide pecu ntau mie hangdeu gage kai eh pecu caiketet. Migede pe kengkieng gade meurünseu de kelilu kera kau gahdi. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Ge hemeuseu cide di süt di. Dede pa ngkieng kelu dau, pe kii kedi de cumdi, nah cipau bam gade pekii mdai pwakcuh di, cide tinggimdung ga tingkai mdai lambie ge saugai.<verse eid="DAN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Penui kakga pekii ket gade pekii kedage pwakcuh dai, kerai dau cide keceuna ge, dede cide tingbangle, naimiak kepetle, nah hezu keyi deu le pwakcuh eh disüt di. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Cide disüt cupwa tinggim reugwame de regi kera mtei lu. Cipau reugwame kangge de nah hegidung kesabedung kelien mie kideu gage kaidi, nah cide ne cipaume de caiketet. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Cide pekatei pecu tei ndu pwa reugwame reu muibe ge teilu. Cide pe dade keru ratak teibam kelade keuteu di, nah pe gu kemci bam tei heradi. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Kengaurau eh kerenia kedine, reugwame de pwa hemeuseu kii dage peu dizie, nah keru ratak cide mtak dizie. Pe kii cide makesangbe kelien pwa hangdeu gage kai dizie, nah pa tei keladung teicang luzie. <verse eid="DAN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Ge Ih kemcime ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemcime ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggim samgwame ge.</char></note> marang nah kemcime kedage pe sam keli eh siu, “Keru ratak, kengkap teu kegwang kemau, Tinggim reugwame nah kemcibam pwa mi pidau ketei marengei aidungde daitie ge tei bam zie no?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:2">Keu. 11:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Pa a dage ranggai, “Ma cide tinghegi nah tingcang 2,300 kecu tingtie ge keu zie. Cipau caine kemci bam petau tei eh teu dai luzie.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Ih, Daniel, hemang rengei cide ngau kegai dau, Ih cide pekie cilu kera tei. Ge mige mipei rehi kenzwa ge a dwaga saplu. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />Ulai reuki kung kakga mige kequ kwa Ih siu. Pa rangdi, “Gabriel, mina aipaude de hemang rengei kie cilu kera rang beulo.” <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Iciu ge pa Ih sap kebam ga gwang nna lu. Pa nna gwang kegai dau, Ih ngngidi nah keumie hangdeu ga bamdi. Pa a dage rangdi, “Cilulo, mina nabo, hemang rengei cide peting kekam dau ziemne delie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:21">Dan. 9:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Pa acu mpau kebam dau, Ih zip zing bam eh hangdeu ga kaumiedi. Ge pa acu deu gai nah acu teucuh saplu. <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />Pa rangdi, “Pielo, pecai Tinggwang lunghop tingdau daitei diziebi kecu ncu pwalia zie, kedanemene hemang cide kekamle ting rietkelu ha ge kecune. <verse eid="DAN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Meurünseu pekii kena pung delwe bam eh nang ngau kegai de, cide au Mediame penai Persiame hegwangpei da. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Hemeuseu be cai Greeceme hegwangpei da. Pemiak kena kakga pekii kedi de hegwangpei raitube da. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Pekii cum kedi de, nah pebam gade pekii mdai pwakcuh kelu de cai, pe leuh gade hegwangram mdai cuh zie, dede pe kengkieng kendu nzwa lak. <verse eid="DAN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />Nah cipau hegwangramdung peting kekamle, hezai gikah pwa penli hangcang kedi dau, hegwang pezu kuu nah mriak süt kecu ge cuh zie. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Pe kengkieng di nah ndu süt zie, dede cide pekatei pe kengkieng gade lak. Pa ngkap kegaidung mimacang dizie; pa bata tei kegaide teicang luzie. Pa mina kengkiengdung de ngkap dizie, kemcime kakga minadung de. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Pa pekang gade pe mriak kesia lepwa kecwabedung pui pet dizie. Pekatei pe lung gade pa ndu pet dizie. Pa cet mning mezing delwe mina kekieege de ngkap dizie. Pa Tinggwang hegwangdung reu hegwang de renia cuh dizie, iciu eh pecu teipang teipop dizie, dede cide mina ba ne lak. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Tinghegidung nah tingcangdung ha rang kebeu hemang rengei de kesangbe da. Dede hemang cide ngkim nzeu lu, kedanemene cide gwang kera mmi kekiee ge caine zielu.” <verse eid="DAN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Ge Ih, Daniel, acu ngamdi nah tingbaziedung kekieege Ih mnei eh zeu kaudi. Pecai Ih cuh lu, nah Ih hegwangpei gwatei bamdi. Dede hemang rengei cide ne acu kebwak nah keheudi, nah cika migede cide cilu kera gahdi.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Daniel kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Darius Ahasuerus napei, Medes leuhme ge. Ahasuerus ne pecu peu Babylonia reu hegwang teilu. <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />Darius hegwang teikelu mmi keraibe kum Ih, Daniel, RAMPAUBE sam laisiukwakdung pei bam, Jeremiah caihakecibe da kegwangbe sam de. Ih mcet kegai Jerusalem de gikedi cangdi kera mmi riakhena bamreu kecu cilu.<verse eid="DAN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Ih kekie tei mmwang, rosopai ba nah mimüt ga bam eh Rampaube Tinggwang de peei kera nreu gwang. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Ih RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang dade kie, nah Ih anui maudung pet. Ih ranggai, “Kehereide, Rampaubo, nang au di nah yitube Tinggwang, nang samkak kelu de kainzeu la nah ncu hung kelame nah n zaidung kainzeu kelame dade nang masang la. <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />Anui mau dida nah petau kemakpe tei dida. Anui kesiabe bata tei dida nah anui n zaidung gade nreu tet eh renia la dida. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Anui n kilame caihakecime n zi teu anui hegwangpeidung, anui muiteume, anui paume nah kideube ga mina leune dage ma kerangme sam kingnei lu meda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:34">Neh. 9:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Rampaubo, n da kemzuibe bam. Dede henai anui zudung ga hengam keteibe bam Judahme nah Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung nah Israelme leune da. Nang ne teizang kedi kideube kenna ga kelame nah kemdei ga kelame de si eh. Aide kedanemene anui ziuyi peei eh ncu renia kedine. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />RAMPAUBO, anui nah anui gwangpeidung, anui muiteumedung nah anui paumedung, hengam tei dida, kedanemene anui ncu renia eh mau dida. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Rampaube anui Tinggwang da au ngaungia nah mimau gibeu kela bam, anui pecu renia di liede. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang pa pe kilamedung caihakecime dage pwa kepeu hezaidung de mzai lu meda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:12">2 Heg. 18:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Israelme leune n zai de gileu dida nah nreu dida, n kwa kingnei rau dida. Anui ncu renia eh kemau tei kedine Tinggwang kilabe Moses zai gage rau teukela reset nah samkak de anui reu gage kaigai da. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />RAMPAUBE anui nah anui reu kedime dage kengkap teugwang gaizie lie eh rang beuda. Kedanemene Jerusalem da teigai kedibe Tinggim kebam leune dage teigai kedidung keda gailak. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Moses zai gage rau teu kela nzwa eh kengkap aidung pelane anui da gwang liede anui maudung gade nreu gwang eh RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dade ngaugia kie luma nah n kesamsang gage anui lung kailu ma. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE kengkap mteilu nah cide anui reuga teugwang gai, kedanemene RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang au pa ketei leune gade de masang, dede anui pe sam mzai ma. <verse eid="DAN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />Cu au Rampaube anui Tinggwang, n ba kengkieng de teu eh nang n minadung de Egypt gade ngngwa mpet beu, nah cudau tingga nzwa nang n katei n zi tei mdulu. Dede cude anui kemau tei; makesiadung tei dida. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Rampaubo, n bata masang leune ziemne, peu n rata nah n lunghop de n namdi Jerusalem gade nreu tetdi lulo, n kemci deutu gade. Anui maudung ziemne nah anui paume maudung ziemne anuide twagwapung kebam leune de Jerusalem nah n minadung de mania kesia ge tei dida. <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Cu, anui Tinggwang, n kilabe kekie nah ngaugia kie eh mra kegai kwa de kingnei gailo; n zi gade, Rampaubo, n kemcibam gikedi ga tau baa gailo. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />A Tinggwang, n kwen ngkeilwe kingnei gailo, n miak mrak lwe pie gailo. N zi gade qu kela namdi de pielo; anui kau dida. Anui petaube teikela ziemne n kengha kie ma, dede n ngaugia kedi ziemne. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Rampaubo, anui kenggia kie kegai kingnei gailo! Rampaubo, kemaugi beulo! Rampaubo, pie mting nah heta tei gailo! N katei n ziemne ridi helo, a Tinggwang, kedanemene Jerusalem n namdi nah n minadung de n zi gade qulu delu.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Riakkena “henadung” de</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Ih marang kebam dau, kekie tei nah a mau nah a mina Israelme mau pet kebam dau, nah RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang dwa gage a kekiedung liagai Tinggwang gu kemci deutu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemci deutu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem </char></note> keleu gade, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />Ih kekie tei kebam dau, minabe Gabriel, Ih amang gade pecu ngau keraibe de, zette eh a da lim gwang, tinghegi reca ketei ting dau.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk. 1:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />Pa acu macilu kebui maci peu iciu eh a dage ranggai, “Daniel, Ih ncu peu kecikecet nah miakngau pwapeu kera cu gwangla da. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />Nang ngaugia kiecu kecu dau, aja kaibeu iciu eh Ih samlibe ncu rangbeu kera gwangla, kedanemene ncu hung süt kecune. Ciziemne sam aide cetlu nah keulia kegaide ci lulo.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />Ntakkak riakhena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ntakkak riakhena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmi haimdaieriakhekui</char></note> au n minadung ziemne hezai nah n kemci namdi depeu kemau teisi tadi kera, kemau gade ngngwa yi dailu kera, kelungta kemzuibe teugwang kera, mangau nah caihakeci de teulu kera, mcitube bam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mcitube bam: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kemci kerecaki</char></note> de teimci kera. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Cet nah cilu lo Jerusalem retak nah tei ncuhdai kera aja kai kebeu gade gwang kedet kelube (pa ne muiteube zie) kegwang kecang dega mtakkak hena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mtakkak hena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pia hena kecu mmi hena.</char></note> nah mtakkak riakherok-kena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mtakkak riakherok-kena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmi riakdai-hekui</char></note> zie. Jerusalem de puididung nah kekwabam de si eh retak dailu zie, keherei eh bam liede. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Mtakkak riakherok-kena kedicai, keniak kelube de ngkap dizie nah magede bamsi lak. Gwangkela hegwang gu reugwame ne namdi nah kemci ni de ngkap dizie. Duinai eh penlibe dizie, nah reutak kamtube ga kecang teizie. Ngkapdi bi kerade riet luda. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Pa mi kekiee de ngngwa piage kecu hena samting samkak luzie. Pa mtakkak ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mtakkak ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmi hekui</char></note> sumbe gade pa ratak nah reca de teingah dizie. Gikedi ta keteime dade kengaurau kecu gwang zie. Gikedi ta keteibe dage kengkap nah penli cangsiak kecu gwang kera riet luda.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Daniel Mina gede kempau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Hegwangpei Cyrus Persia ga hegwang teikelu mmi pe kecumbe kum, Daniel, Belteshazzar lie de qu kelabe da sam ge keulia. Sam aide kesang. Cide hereu reudi ketei ha ge. Daniel sam de cilu pa marengei kengau gade. <verse eid="DAN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Cipau tingdau Ih, Daniel mtakkak kecum hei eh hap bamdi. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Ih taktyei keyi tyei ma, Ih hetei tyei ma. Ih zau sak ma, nah mtakkak kecum de cangdi kemaktane akatei acu maca le keniak ma. <verse eid="DAN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Kei raitube kei, zie ngkaiemdai benai, Ih kereuki kedi (cide Tigris) kung ga kela dau, <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />Ih ngang cuh piegai nah mige langcimpai bah eh kebam ngau, nah Uphaz le teikelu kecak kemci kiakang pe kia gage kai teula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:13">Keu. 1:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Pepum au topaz nzwa, nah pezu au tingkehepik nzwa. Pe miak kena au heukebam mitaubung nzwa, nah pe badung nah pe pidung au hetageu teu mdui kelube nzwa. Pa kerang kwadung au hemaa kedi kwa ge nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:14">Keu. 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Ih, Daniel, akatei rünne marengei ngau, kedanemene acu ngngwa kelamedung marengei ngau ma. Dede, kehing kedi ge penui da gwang, nah penui mbai kera pakdi. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Cine Ih akatei di nah marengei kedi aide ngau. Kengkieng a da bam tadi; a reba zu de lipwa ngkap kedi zu ge di, nah a da kengkieng ba bam sita di. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Ge Ih pesamdung siu, nah Ih cide kingnei kebamdau, Ih zip zing eh hangdeu ga kaumiedi.<verse eid="DAN 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Heba ge acu tunggai, nah cide ne a ngkokpui nah a badeu tei mbeudi. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />Tinggimgwame a dage rangdi, “O Daniel, kemlang minabo, Ih n dage rang kebam samde ci lulo. Cuh saplu, kedanemene acu lang pwa n dage kai gaida.” Pa sam cide a da rang kegai dau, Ih mbeu eh cuhlu. <verse eid="DAN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Ge pa a dage rangdi, “Ngngi helo, Daniel. Raitu benai gade nang cilu kebui n sam pet kegai dau nah n Tinggwang dwa gage nkatei ncu tei hena kegai dau, n samdung kingnei luda, nah n sam petkegai ziemne Ih n da gwang lada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Persia hegwangram gu hegwangpei acu renia, nah acu Persia gwangpeime de ncüt delwe cikage zie ngkaieket acu kainzeu. Dede Michael, hegwang napei, a da gwang eh acu ngha beu. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />Cu tingbazie kekamle n minadung dage daitei gwang ziebi kecu peu ncu cilu kerane Ih ngha kera gwangla. Kedanemene marengei cide au gwang kera tingbazie kekambe ziemne.” <verse eid="DAN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Pa sam aidungde teu acu mpau kebam dau, Ih made rang gailak di eh keumie hangdeu piedi. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Mige mina nabedung kenzwa ge a muileu tunggai, nah iciu eh Ih a mui ngkei eh a dwaga kesapbe dage ranggai, “A mpaubo, Ih marengei de ziemne Ih keherei dida; Ih a da kengkieng gede bamsi meda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:9">Jer. 1:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Ih n kilabe. Ih daizwa delwe a mpaube de ngngwa mpau lulai? Kedanemene Ih kengkieng gede a da gah da, nah a cuingi gede a da bamsi meda.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Iciuge mige mina rehi kenzwabe ge acu tunggai nah acu tei ngkieng gai. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Pa rangdi, “Ngngi helo, mina pemi kehungbo. Kezuyibe peu n da bam kelube teilo! Ngkienglu cu au, ngkienglu!” Pa a dage marang kebam dau, Ih ngkieng dailu. Ih ranggai, “Peu a mpaube de marang lo, kedanemene nang acu tei ngkiengbeu delu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:10">Isa. 41:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />Pa rangdi, “Ih daitei eh n da gwang labi kecu nang ci mi? Ih zette eh Persia ga hegwang napei de regi kera caili dizie da. Ih tetdi de Greeceme hegwangpei gwang zie. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Dede Kesang Laisiukwak gage rauteu kelade Ih n dage ranglia zie. Tinggimgwame Michael rünne gwale, mi gede pekatei pe kengkieng keulia eh acu ngngwa penuide renia kera gah.”<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />Medeme pei Darius hegwang tei kelu mmi raitube kum, Ih akatei Michael de gumbeu nah pe lam pwabeu kera gwang.<verse eid="DAN 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tingbangle nah tingpile gwangpei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Cu Ih n dage kesangbe ranglia zie. Persia ga hegwang hangcum cuh zie, nah pe mdaibe au kedamedung swade mahei kizie. Pa pe mahei gade kengkieng ngau lude, pa Greece gwangram de renia kera mileune de teu keri gaizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Iciu eh Hegwangram kendu kedi reu hegwang tei kerane hegwang ge cuh zie, nah pa pe bata pe lungningbe nzwa teizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Pa kedi teilu de, pe hegwangram pangpwa tinggim ga tingkaidung mdai gage mzigai dizie, dede pekatei pe leuhme dage lak, nah pe kengkieng le lak pa kedi tei kela dau. Kedanemene pe hegwangram de kedame ziemne pai mpetti zie pe dade lunggwang kemakme.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />Tingbangle hegwangpei ngkieng dizie, dede pe kangga kebam reugwa muibe hangge pe swade ngkiengki zie nah kengkieng kedi teu eh hegwang teizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Mmi kie kemakge cai, peting petau lude, penui ngngwa ket tei dizie. Tingbangle gu hegwangpei napui tingtünle gu hegwangpei da gwang eh kesamkak ta teizie. Dede cipau pui de pe ba ga kengkieng de kainzeu lak, mede hegwangpei de sap gailak, mede pe ba kengkieng bam gailak. Mipui cide de gihdi zie, pa nah pecu ngngwa gwang kebeume de de, nah pepei de de, nah cipau tingdau pelam pwabeu kebamme de de.<verse eid="DAN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Dede pe kibaume gade hangge cuh eh pebam leu zie. Pa reugwamedung de gwa ketang zie nah tingtünle gu hegwangpei kengkiengbam ga lüt zie. Pa penuide regi zie, nah penuide ngam lu zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Pa penui rabe miedung nah kecak pemi kehung lidung Egypt gage punggai dizie. Mmi kie kemak ge pa tingtünle gwangpei dade mdei ladi zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Pecai tingtünle gwangpei tingbangle gwangpei bam de gwa zie, dede pa pekatei pedeu ga cailigwang dizie.<verse eid="DAN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Pe napeimedung mteilwe reugwa maa kedi ge hekwalu zie. Cide gwang jüja bam eh maleune hampwa dizie; cide lampui leune kah gwang rietegwa kelu gwangbam cang zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Pecai tingbangle gwangpei pe rata süt dizie; pa mie delwe tingtünle gwangpei de regi zie. Tingtünle gwangpei reugwa maa kedi ncu luzie, dede reugwame tuilu zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Reugwame de ngngwa tet dizie, nah tingbangle gwangpei ngang dizie, nah pa cangcang cu kereei de tei ngkau gaizie, dede pa ngkieng gailak. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Pecai tingtünle gwangpei reugwame keda ge ncuh luzie, keraibe swade diki kecuge. Mmi kiee kemak ge cai, tingtünle gwangpei reugwame kedi ge reugwa nia keyi teu eh gwang dai zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Cipau tingdau mina kekieege tingbangle gwangpei de renia eh cuhzie. N mina kakgade kesiabe napeimedung marengei de teicang kera tei zie, dede penui kau dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Tingtünle gwangpei kideube de nah rietegwa kenzeu namdi gede tuih lu kerane lwa gwang zie. Tingbangle gu kengkieng cui saplu gailak dizie, penui gu reugwa yitumedung liede sap gailak. Penui saplu kera kengkieng kette bam lak. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Meliene, gwang kelabe penuide renia pwa pekatei pe lungsuibe tei teudi zie; migede pe lampui ga sap lak. Pa hezu keyi deu ga sap zie, nah tei ngkaplu kera pe ba ga bam dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Tingtünle gwangpei pe hegwangram kengkieng pelane teu eh gwang kera mtei luzie, nah pa tingbangle hegwangpei de ngngwa samkak kera ge la zie. Pa pecu pe napuime gede kelak tei kera peu zie iciu eh tingbangle hegwangram de tei ngkaulu kerane. Dede mariem cide teidau gailak mede pecu ngha lak. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Aipau cai, tingtünle gwangpei duidikungdung gage pelung kai zie nah cipaumedung kekieege de tuih luzie. Dede reugwa muibe ne pe zai kesia de tei ngkap dizie nah pe zaisiet lepwa pe reu gage nreu caili kera tei zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Pecai pa pekatei pe deu ga riekelu namdung gage pelung kai zie, dede pecu teingkap dizie; pecu ngaulu ta dizie.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />Pecai pe keleu gade mige cuh zie, cipaude heraha ha kelame de peu kahgwang lu kera peu zie pe hegwangram hezu keyi de ziemne. Dede matie mene pa pangpop dizie, dede cide rata gade, mede hereu gade de ma. <verse eid="DAN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Pe keleu gade mi ngaukerau mege cuh zie minadung pecu hegwangme herüt kengkieng de peu lak; pa cet mezing kebam dau gwang zie nah hegwangram cide heciem tei eh keuteu dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Pe dwa gade duinai kegwang nzwa reugwame de biakteu dizie. Reugwame de de nah samkakkelu cingkupei kedibe de de ngkap dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Pecu ngngwa keyi teikelu tingdau gade, pa hecwa bata tei dizie; mina hemaa keceuna ge rünne ngngwa eh pa ngkieng dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Pa mrairang mene deuceu heitube sau ga lüt zie, nah pa pe pei nah pe paume de teila kemakpe tadung tei zie. Pa süt kelube, tei msia kelube, maheidung pe caisuime dage teizang gai zie. Pa riekelu nam ngam kera tariem telei zie, dede cide tingkak ge gwale lak. <verse eid="DAN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />Pa pe kengkieng gade nah pa pelung gade reugwame kengkieng teu eh tingbangle ga gwangpei de regi kera cuh zie. Iciu eh tingbangle gwangpei reugwame ngkieng süt kecu teu regi zie, dede pa saplu lak kedanemene mina kedame pecu renia kera heta tei zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Pegu taktyei keyi tyei kelame de pecu ngkap kera teizie. Pe reugwame de au duinai kecu nzwa biakteu dizie, nah penui mina kekiee gede teitset dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Hegwang aipau kena de, hangge dage kesia teigai kerane penai lungcet telei lu, kempaubam ge ga penai bam delwe hangge dade kenret zie, dede cide kemmi bam lak. Kedanemene penlibe riet kelu tingdau gwangdi zie.<verse eid="DAN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Pecai tingtünle gwangpei pe deuga pe lung gade kemci samkak de renia kera lungcet teu nah mahei kedi pung eh cailigwang dizie. Pa bata teizie nah pe deuga cailigwang dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />Riet kelu tingsiak dau pa caili tingbangle gwangpei de renia kera gwang dai zie. Dede henaipia au pedwa swa tsam zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Kedanemene Kittimme liemdung pecu renia kera gwang zie, nah pa ngngi dizie nah caili dizie. Pa kemci samkak de renia eh pe rata süt dizie, nah pa kemci samkak de püt kedime de pe suiyi keulia zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Pe reugwamedung riekelu kemci ni de teihera dizie. Penui tei jüja kela keru ratak reca de keutet dizie, nah penui ngkap kedi ngau kenghet ge tei dizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Samkak kelude de renia eh bata kesia keteime ziemne au, pa ne penuide cwadi nah tei msia dizie. Dede minadung pe Tinggwang de ci kebam medung au ngkieng eh penui bata tei zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Mina kakga kemteume au mina kekieege dage kecikecet peu zie. Dede kingtie nah mi gade penui kau dizie; penuide nim teudi zie nah tingbazie kekieege penui dade rega zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Penui kau kela gade, kengha keceuna ge penui de ngha zie. Mina kekiee ge hezai tei eh penui maa ga ncüt zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Kemteume kangge kaudi zie, iciu eh tei keheci penui da peu tei lu kerane, nah tei kemci, nah tei keheci de peting kamtube cang kemaktane tei zie. Kedanemene riet kelu tingbe gwang lai zeureu kecune.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pekatei pecu teimdi kelube gwangpei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />Tingtünle Syria gwangpei pe lungning nzwa batadung tei dizie. Pa pekatei pecu teu ncuh pwa rabe leune reu kaizie. Pa rabedung reu Tinggwang dage mimakecang samdung rang eh pecu renia zie, kedanemene pa cide teicang lubui lunghop cide cangdi kemaktane. Kedanemene tei zielie rangteu kela teicang zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Pa pe paume rabedung de masipei lak mede mipuidung penui suiyi kela rabe de de. Pa rabe keda keheibe de de mapeei lak. Kedanemene pa pelane reu pekatei pecu lepwa kedibe teizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Aidung de swade pa riekelu namdi rabe de rüt zie. Rabe cide pe paume ci kemak rabe ge, cide de pa rangkanggeu nah kecak, pemi kehung tangtsu nah mapeudung lepwa herüt peu zie. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Pa sangme rabe de ngngwa riekelu namdi ngkiengtube de gwa ketang zie. Mi keheibe de pecu penui gwangpei lie kelame de pa herüt peu zie. Pa penuide mina kekieege reu hegwang tei kera teibeu zie, nah pa kideu mzi pwa penui ziehi teibeu zie.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />Peting kamtube ga tingbangle gwangpei gwa ketang zie. Tingtünle Syria gwangpei de hekwen bagi nah hekwen keteumedung, nah heliemdung kekiee teu eh pecu gwaketang zie. Pa kideumedung de renia zie, penuide kah gwang ngam luzie. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Pa hezukeyi deu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hezukeyi deu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel deudi. </char></note> ga gwang zie, nah Israelme pecang cang kau dizie. Dede aidungde pe ba gade pak luzie: Edom, Moab, nah Ammonme bang kelume. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Pa pe ba hwapwa kideudung gage kaizie; Egyptme deu de keli gailak. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Pa kecak nah rangkanggeu reu kezeu luzie, nah Egypt reu mahei pelane de; Libyame nah Cushme de pa pe pidau teizie. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Dede naimiak kepetle nah tingtünle de samci ne pecu keheu dizie, nah pa liagai kelak rata teu tetpet zie tei ngkapti kera nah sau kekieege tei msia di kera. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Pa hezukeyi Mediterranean jaaidi nah Zion kemci hangdeutu kakgage pe kedi paiki ncuh luzie. Pa penlibe ga gwang zie, nah cika pecu kengha kera mi gede bamlak.<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Peting Penli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />“Cipau ting dau Michael, hegwangnapei kedibe n mina mapie kelabe, cuh luzie. Cidau keherei kecu ting ge zie, heleuhbe lungh cuhkelu gade aipauting de kecang madaude ciciula kemak ge zie. Cipau tingdau n minadungde, laisiukwak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Laisiukwak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kering laisiukwak cf. Tet. 32:32-33, Lei. 69:28, Keu. 3:5</char></note> ga pe zi rau pwabam eh ngaukelu leune de kelilu zie. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Kideube rebui ga zip kedime ringcuh zie, kangge kelungta kering ga nah kangge hengam ga nah kelungta keherei zie. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Kemteumedung tinggim kebaa nzwa baa zie, nah kekieege lungh tei nreupwa makesang gage kai kelume, cipaume au kelungta nah kelungta hegidung nzwa zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:43">Mat. 13:43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />Dede nang Daniel, sam aidungde kebai di; laisiukwak ngkuidi peting kekambe cang kemaktane. Mi kekieege luga aika pak gwang pak mie zie, iciu eh maci kieesi luzie.”<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Pecai I, Daniel, piegai, nah cika keda hangna sapbam. Hangge hereuki ailam gim kungga sap, nah hangge hereuki lulegim kungga sap. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Penai hangge langcimpai bah eh hereuki nreule lulegim ga kebambe dage rangdi, “Miswakegah ta aidungde kamtu ga gwangcang kera daitie ge zie no?” <verse eid="DAN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Ih minabe langcimpai bah delwe hereuki lulegim nreule kebambe dade siu, pa pe ba zetle nah pe ba hile tinggim gage hwacuh delwe kelungta ring kelabe Tinggwang zi gade reset eh cide mmi ge, mmi kena, mmi pempie ge zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mmi ge, mmi kena, mmi pempie ge zie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmi kecum eh pie.</char></note> Kamtube kemci minadung kengkieng cang kedi dau, ma aidung pelane cangdi zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:5-7">Keu. 10:5-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Ih siuda, dede Ih cilu ma, Cine Ih keteu, “A mpaubo, aidung pelane dai nzwadi zieno?” <verse eid="DAN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Pa rangdi, “N lampui ga gwangcu, Daniel, kedanemene samdung au kebai dida nah kaudap dap dida kamtube ting cang kemaktane. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Mina kekieege de teiheci luzie, mci luzie, tei heci dizie, dede kesiame au kesiabe bata teizie. Mina kesiame mige de cilak, dede kemteume au ci luzie. <verse eid="DAN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />Tei jüja bamkela keru ratak reca de kam kedi ting gade nah kengaurau dene ngkap cangsiakdi kera mteilu, cika tingbazie 1,290 bamzie. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Kamtube tingba ziedung 1,335 de kwa kelume samlam pungtu. <verse eid="DAN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />Nah nang, Daniel, n teilung kamtube kecang de kesamsang ga tetla maisia, iciu eh nang mtak luzie. Kamtube tingbaziedung ga, ncu kepeu ni de ga nang cuh dai luzie.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>